		(at 64.5 32.75 180)
		(descr "LED, diameter 3.0mm, horizontal offset 1.27mm, z-position of LED center 2.0mm, 2 pins, infrared, black. Fork of LED_THT:LED_D3.0mm_Horizontal_O1.27mm_Z2.0mm_IRBlack for c6remote D1. Pad shapes swapped so the square is pin 2 anode, + and - glyphs added beside the pads, and the silk body outline trimmed to the on-board portion because the real body overhangs the top board edge by about 2.6mm; the full lying-down body stays on F.Fab and F.CrtYd, which carry no edge-clearance rule.")
